config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Inter, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
    primaryColor: "#172033"
    primaryTextColor: "#1d2939"
    primaryBorderColor: "#60708a"
    lineColor: "#5e6c84"
    actorBkg: "#172033"
    actorBorder: "#5d7396"
    actorTextColor: "#ffffff"
    signalColor: "#344054"
    signalTextColor: "#1d2939"
    noteBkgColor: "#fff7df"
    noteBorderColor: "#b78632"
    noteTextColor: "#4b3710"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 评委
    participant D as Dashboard / Nginx
    participant G as GoPilot Runtime
    participant L as Investigation Ledger
    participant M as DeepSeek API
    participant T as Evidence Tools
    participant C as Collector
    participant S as demo-service

    U->>D: 点击“开始诊断”
    D->>G: POST /api/diagnoses
    G->>L: 创建 inv_... Investigation
    G->>M: Chat Completions<br/>tools + tool_choice: required
    M-->>G: assistant.tool_calls

    loop 最多 8 个模型步骤，可包含多个 Tool Call
        G->>G: 校验 Tool 名称与 JSON 参数
        G->>T: 执行 get_service_status / metrics / profile
        T->>C: 请求真实证据
        C->>S: health / runtime / leak status / pprof
        S-->>C: 当前服务观测
        C-->>T: 有界、规范化数据
        T-->>G: Observation Envelope（obs_...）
        G->>L: 记录步骤并保存成功 Observation
        G->>M: role=tool + 原 tool_call_id + Envelope
        M-->>G: 下一组 Tool Calls
    end

    M-->>G: submit_diagnosis(evidence_refs)
    G->>L: 校验引用属于当前 Investigation
    alt 引用有效
        G->>L: 从 Observation 物化 Diagnosis.Evidence
        G->>G: 生成 Diagnosis + 服务端时间线
        G-->>D: 200 完整结构化 Diagnosis
        D-->>U: 展示调查轨迹、根因与真实证据
    else 引用无效或跨 Investigation
        G->>L: 记录失败步骤
        G->>M: 返回 invalid_diagnosis Tool Result
    end

    Note over M,S: 模型只请求 Tool Call；本地 Tool 始终由 GoPilot 执行
